WEBVTT

00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:10.342
[Shark] Excuse me.
Is this the ladies' room?

00:00:11.219 --> 00:00:15.055
Oh, uh, you need to take a right
at the end of the hall, ma'am.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.266
[gasps] Whoa.

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:22.396
Yes! Whoop-bam!

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:24.857
Oh, come on!

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:29.528
And now, it is my honor to award
Professor Marmalade

00:00:29.612 --> 00:00:33.449
with the Golden Dolphin!

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:35.242
[guests murmuring]

00:00:35.326 --> 00:00:36.785
- No!
- No!

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:39.621
Yes! I mean, yes!

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:41.540
What?

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:45.502
[screams]

00:00:47.297 --> 00:00:49.882
- Everyone, everyone, please don't panic.
- [guests murmuring]

00:00:49.966 --> 00:00:51.049
Just stay calm.

00:00:51.134 --> 00:00:53.302
I'm sure there's an explanation for this.

00:00:54.637 --> 00:00:58.015
I repeat, please do not panic.

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:01.643
[Wolf] Nice work, everybody.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:04.938
Now, let's make like a wolf
and get the pack outta here.

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:06.648
Ah, wordplay.

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:08.358
I don't get it.

00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:10.068
[Marmalade]
Diane, Diane, if I may...

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:12.196
You have to understand,

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:15.783
I didn't bring hope back to the city
for an award.

00:01:15.867 --> 00:01:19.453
I did these good things
because of how they made me feel.

00:01:19.537 --> 00:01:22.539
That tingly feeling I get.
That shiver up my spine.

00:01:22.624 --> 00:01:25.626
The wag in my tiny tail.

00:01:27.086 --> 00:01:28.378
Because you see,

00:01:28.463 --> 00:01:32.674
being good just feels so good.

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:35.969
And when you're good, you're loved.

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:40.140
- Huh?
- Wolf?

00:01:40.225 --> 00:01:41.558
- What are you doing?
- What are you doing?

00:01:41.643 --> 00:01:42.643
- [Tarantula] Go!
- [Shark] Go!

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.437
It's the Bad Guys!

00:01:45.522 --> 00:01:46.688
Arrest them!

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:48.982
Hut, hut, hut, hut, hut, hut, hut, hut!

00:01:52.403 --> 00:01:54.446
They stole the Golden Dolphin!

00:01:54.531 --> 00:01:56.532
Come on, you can't prove that.

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:57.783
[metal clanking]

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.577
My baby!

00:02:00.662 --> 00:02:03.455
On your knees, Bad Guys,
with your hands up!

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.707
Never! We're outta here.

00:02:08.253 --> 00:02:10.462
So long, suckers!

00:02:16.719 --> 00:02:19.263
Well, this just got a little weird.

00:02:19.347 --> 00:02:20.347
[siren wailing]

00:02:21.724 --> 00:02:23.433
<i>[Tiffany Fluffit] The Bad Guys go bust!</i>

00:02:23.518 --> 00:02:26.603
<i>The nefarious fivesome</i>
<i>has finally been captured.</i>

00:02:26.688 --> 00:02:29.314
<i>And I, Tiffany Fluffit,</i>
<i>am first on the scene.</i>

00:02:29.399 --> 00:02:31.400
Wow. You know, I just realized

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:34.653
that I have devoted my entire adult life
to putting you in jail.

00:02:34.737 --> 00:02:36.321
You are my purpose.

00:02:36.406 --> 00:02:38.407
Without you, who am I?

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:39.575
I'm just kiddin'!

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:42.160
This is the best moment of my life!

00:02:42.245 --> 00:02:45.372
It's the end of the Bad Guys.

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:46.874
No!

00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:48.959
Get your hands off of me.

00:02:49.043 --> 00:02:51.336
You're begging for
a bitin' right now.

00:02:51.421 --> 00:02:52.588
Wolf!

00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:58.677
[reporter] Professor Marmalade!
Madam Governor!

00:02:58.761 --> 00:02:59.845
Professor Marmalade!

00:02:59.929 --> 00:03:02.347
- Madam Governor! Madam Governor!
- One at a time. One at a time.

00:03:04.893 --> 00:03:05.934
- Hey. Hey!
- Excuse me.

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:07.895
- [reporters gasp]
- Sorry to interrupt,

00:03:07.979 --> 00:03:10.689
I just wanted to congratulate
the governor here.

00:03:10.773 --> 00:03:13.483
I gotta say, you really got us pegged.

00:03:13.568 --> 00:03:17.821
We're just a deep well
of anger and self-loathing.

00:03:17.906 --> 00:03:19.615
- Denial.
- [Wolf] Sure. That too.

00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:20.908
- Narcissism.
- [Wolf] Yeah. Yeah.

00:03:20.992 --> 00:03:22.242
Emotional emptiness.

00:03:22.327 --> 00:03:23.660
So, we're on the same page.

00:03:23.745 --> 00:03:25.787
What is he doin'?

00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:28.916
Sadly, we were never given a chance

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:32.377
to be anything more
than second-rate criminals.

00:03:32.462 --> 00:03:34.504
If only there was someone

00:03:34.589 --> 00:03:38.884
who could help the flower of goodness
inside us blossom.

00:03:38.968 --> 00:03:41.845
Some icon of love and forgiveness, like...

00:03:42.639 --> 00:03:44.640
I don't know, Mother Teresa.

00:03:44.724 --> 00:03:49.686
Best thing is to just throw us in jail
for the rest of our hopeless lives.

00:03:49.771 --> 00:03:51.605
Yeah, that's the plan.

00:03:52.607 --> 00:03:53.774
Wait, wait! No, no!

00:03:53.858 --> 00:03:55.609
- Get in there.
- Ow!

00:03:56.194 --> 00:03:58.278
- [Marmalade] Wait!
- [people murmuring]

00:03:58.363 --> 00:03:59.738
B-Beg pardon?

00:03:59.822 --> 00:04:01.949
Mr. Wolf may be a savage beast.

00:04:02.033 --> 00:04:03.533
Basically, walking garbage.

00:04:03.618 --> 00:04:04.952
Sorry, I'm making a point.

00:04:05.036 --> 00:04:06.620
Do what you need to do, pal.

00:04:06.704 --> 00:04:11.249
But how can we say they're hopeless
if they've never been given a chance?

00:04:11.334 --> 00:04:12.376
What if...

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:14.378
What if we tried
a little experiment, Diane?

00:04:14.462 --> 00:04:16.755
As you know,
my Gala for Goodness...

00:04:16.839 --> 00:04:20.717
the #Charity Event of the Year
is coming up.

00:04:20.802 --> 00:04:24.346
If I can prove to everyone at that gala
that the Bad Guys have changed,

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:27.224
will you set them free
and give them a clean start?

00:04:27.308 --> 00:04:29.059
[people gasping]

00:04:29.143 --> 00:04:30.727
What? Professor Marmalade!

00:04:30.812 --> 00:04:31.853
No, no, no.

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:34.314
Don't you see what he's doing?
He's playing you!

00:04:34.399 --> 00:04:35.565
But it was my idea.

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:36.775
It was his idea.

00:04:36.859 --> 00:04:38.860
But only because you made him have it!

00:04:38.945 --> 00:04:41.321
Madam Governor,
you can't just let them go.

00:04:41.406 --> 00:04:44.157
Professor, I'm not about to
put the safety of the city on the line

00:04:44.242 --> 00:04:45.701
for an experiment.

00:04:45.785 --> 00:04:47.452
Excuse me, Madam Governor.

00:04:47.537 --> 00:04:51.039
I seem to remember that
a wise person once said,

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:55.127
"Even trash can be recycled
into something beautiful."

00:04:56.004 --> 00:04:57.212
[scoffs]

00:04:59.173 --> 00:05:00.465
Okay. I'm game.

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:02.926
But only because it's you, Professor.

00:05:03.011 --> 00:05:03.969
No!

00:05:04.053 --> 00:05:06.555
We'll hold onto the dolphin
until the gala,

00:05:06.639 --> 00:05:09.850
just to remove
any unnecessary temptation.

00:05:09.934 --> 00:05:12.060
Of course. Good thinking.

00:05:12.145 --> 00:05:14.146
That's why you're governor.

00:05:14.981 --> 00:05:16.398
Now that everyone's happy...

00:05:16.482 --> 00:05:17.983
Not happy.

00:05:18.067 --> 00:05:22.696
...I, Rupert Marmalade the Fourth,
will turn the Bad Guys into

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:24.448
the Good Guys!

00:05:24.532 --> 00:05:26.783
[all] Ooh!

00:05:29.037 --> 00:05:31.455
I think these belong to you.

00:05:31.539 --> 00:05:32.539
Hey!

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.043
[Diane] Not everyone gets a second chance.

00:05:36.711 --> 00:05:40.005
Make the most of it, Mr. Poodleton.

00:05:45.887 --> 00:05:48.180
[sirens wailing]

00:05:50.224 --> 00:05:51.516
[Snake] Wolf.

00:05:51.601 --> 00:05:52.851
What are you doing?

00:05:52.935 --> 00:05:54.352
- [Wolf] What?
- Yeah.

00:05:54.437 --> 00:05:55.854
Oh, that!

00:05:57.398 --> 00:05:59.274
I'm sorry, I thought it was obvious.

00:05:59.358 --> 00:06:01.276
We're gonna go good.

00:06:03.196 --> 00:06:04.571
Uh, you totally lost me.

00:06:04.655 --> 00:06:06.698
I told him to stop drinkin'
out of the toilet.

00:06:06.783 --> 00:06:08.700
Hey, did you get hit on the head?

00:06:08.785 --> 00:06:09.868
What? No, I didn't get...

00:06:09.952 --> 00:06:11.828
My cousin got hit on the head
with an anchor,

00:06:11.913 --> 00:06:13.747
and after that,
he only swam in a circle.

00:06:13.831 --> 00:06:15.749
No, guy, guys, guys.
You're not following me.

00:06:15.833 --> 00:06:18.794
We're gonna pretend to go good.

00:06:18.878 --> 00:06:20.629
Just a few days with Marmalade.

00:06:20.713 --> 00:06:24.633
And then,
we roll into the gala as good guys

00:06:24.717 --> 00:06:27.969
and roll out scot-free with...

00:06:28.679 --> 00:06:30.889
[all] The Golden Dolphin!

00:06:30.973 --> 00:06:32.099
You got it.

00:06:32.183 --> 00:06:34.392
Since when do we not finish a job?

00:06:34.477 --> 00:06:37.771
The Bad Guys become the Good Guys

00:06:37.855 --> 00:06:41.191
so we can stay the bad guys.

00:06:41.275 --> 00:06:43.276
- You know what I'm saying?
- [all laughing]

00:06:43.361 --> 00:06:45.278
Bad guys acting good?

00:06:45.363 --> 00:06:48.198
It's the ultimate bad-guy thing.
It's fantastic.

00:06:48.282 --> 00:06:49.908
Wolf, you're a genius!

00:06:51.702 --> 00:06:54.037
It's gonna be, like,
the most relaxing con ever.

00:06:54.122 --> 00:06:55.455
Like a vacation.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:57.916
Oh, oh-oh-oh! A con-cation.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:00.961
- [all laughing]
- [siren wailing continues]

00:07:01.045 --> 00:07:03.046
[Shark] My parents met on a con-cation!

00:07:05.007 --> 00:07:07.300
[seagulls squawking]

00:07:08.886 --> 00:07:12.639
[Marmalade humming]

00:07:15.893 --> 00:07:17.352
[doorbell rings]

00:07:17.436 --> 00:07:18.728
Oh, goody!

00:07:18.813 --> 00:07:20.147
[Wolf] Wow!

00:07:20.231 --> 00:07:21.815
[Tarantula] Big and fancy.

00:07:21.899 --> 00:07:24.609
Rodent's got taste. Okay!

00:07:25.194 --> 00:07:27.070
Almost makes me wanna be cute.

00:07:27.155 --> 00:07:30.574
[Marmalade]
They say experience is the best teacher.

00:07:30.658 --> 00:07:32.576
And they are wrong.

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:33.660
I am.

00:07:33.744 --> 00:07:36.204
Good morning,
students of goodness.

00:07:36.289 --> 00:07:41.293
And welcome to the first day
of the rest of your best life.

00:07:41.377 --> 00:07:42.711
A giant butt!

00:07:43.296 --> 00:07:44.296
Huh?

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:46.006
Uh, it's... it's not a butt.

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:49.759
It's a lamp in the shape
of the Love Crater Meteorite,

00:07:49.844 --> 00:07:50.802
my greatest...

00:07:50.887 --> 00:07:51.970
I wonder whose butt it is.

00:07:52.054 --> 00:07:53.305
- [Wolf gasps]
- Uh...

00:07:53.389 --> 00:07:56.183
Once again,
it's not a butt, thank you.

00:07:56.267 --> 00:07:57.309
It's a heart.

00:07:57.393 --> 00:07:59.269
- Now, as I was saying...
- Then why does it have cheeks?

00:07:59.353 --> 00:08:00.353
- Shut it!
- What?

00:08:00.438 --> 00:08:01.730
I've never seen a heart
with cheeks.

00:08:01.814 --> 00:08:04.191
- [chuckles] It's not a...
- Booty!

00:08:04.275 --> 00:08:06.276
It's not a butt! Not a butt!

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:07.986
Does he know what a butt is?

